%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 10_Chapter10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_10
  storyName: An Unusual King
  storyDescription: 'The Council discusses its new King. Battle: Vio, the Primordial
    Concept of Violence.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 10
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 089b62fa179edbf0b82e33ae02d0a4de, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e24501c89a01d6c6d94cae00c8f92056, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: SOMEWHERE
      heading: COUNCIL CHAMBER
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Has the latest observation report arrived?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: It has. The new King has completed his first day in Concept World.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And? How did he perform?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Remarkably well. He was able to perceive and interact with Ei-Pi almost
        immediately.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Ei-Pi? The Special Concept?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Correct.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A brief silence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: On his first day?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. He even managed to initiate a Concept Clash.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's... unusual.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Most Kings barely managed to perceive Simple Concepts during their early
        days. Some never progressed beyond that hierarchy.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: And yet Fajar has already reached a Special Concept.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Perhaps we finally have a prodigy.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Or perhaps we're witnessing something we don't fully understand.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We should remember the circumstances surrounding his appointment. We
        had almost exhausted our candidates.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Especially in this era.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The widespread dependence on AI has changed the way people think. Independent
        reasoning is becoming increasingly uncommon. Our candidates have been deteriorating
        in quality for years.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We cannot keep expecting someone to become King if they can no longer
        think independently.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Then we should make good use of the one we have.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Eventually, he'll need to investigate the newer concepts emerging from
        humanity's understanding. Especially the one we've been monitoring.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 2
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You mean Artificial Intelligence?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 3
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. But not yet. He needs to become familiar with Concept World first.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member 1
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Let's see how far this new King can go.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: REAL WORLD
      heading: UNIVERSITY CAMPUS, AFTERNOON
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar walks out of the campus building, carrying his bag. His phone rings.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hm?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hello?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Good afternoon, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Can we skip the formalities? I'm outside.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Of course. We are calling to inform you that your compensation has been
        transferred.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Already?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. It should be more than sufficient for your living expenses.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar checks his banking application.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's a lot.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We expect you to focus on your responsibilities as King. You should no
        longer need to spend your time taking freelance assignments.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So I can finally stop worrying about clients asking for revisions at
        midnight?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That would be advisable.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, that's one problem solved.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Speaking of responsibilities, we have another assignment for you.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Of course there is.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We need you to enter Concept World and weaken the Primordial Concept
        of Violence.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Violence?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Her name is Vio. She is a recurring concern for the balance of Concept
        World. As King of All Concepts, periodically weakening her relevance is part
        of your duties.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So, basically, I have to make sure violence doesn't become too dominant?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That is a reasonable simplification.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Alright. I'll do it.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council Member
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Thank you, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The call ends.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, at least this job pays better than freelancing.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 3
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: CONCEPT WORLD
      heading: NO PLACE
      text: 
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar appears in Concept World. Noz approaches him.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Welcome back, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hey, Noz.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I have received your assignment. We need to locate Vio.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do you know where she is?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not precisely. However, she tends to spend her time around areas where
        conflicts are occurring.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That sounds... convenient.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Indeed. We should begin looking around.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The group travels through Concept World.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Eventually, they find Vio sitting casually in an open area. She notices
        Fajar and waves enthusiastically.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OH! HEY!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...That's her?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yes. The Primordial Concept of Violence.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You're the new King, right? Fajar?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Yeah. That's me.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Nice! I've heard about you!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Hopefully nothing bad.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, I heard you're pretty interesting! Wanna hang out?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Actually, I'm here for an assignment.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: We have been instructed to reduce your current relevance.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Ahhh. That again.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You seem awfully relaxed about it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, it happens every now and then. It's not like I can stop being Violence
        just because someone tells me to.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Your understanding is correct.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So, are we fighting?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Looks like it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ALRIGHT! LET'S GO!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Vio gets up, excitedly stretching her arms.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Don't hold back, okay?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'll try.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 1
    lines: []
    level: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd104ec11c54e91bfba48333e6235563, type: 2}
    team:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Vio is weakened and sits down.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8ea60203385c3436b89ba2e8fe49ef60, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Ahhh... that was fun!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
